{"ts":"2026-08-31T18:38:14.550Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"63a54ff4e404ee8cfcd5d3d8","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-31T18:38:14.550Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-31T18:38:14.550Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Bumped @unbrained/pm-cli from 2026.8.20 to 2026.8.31 (exact pin, no caret/range). Confirmed: ./node_modules/.bin/pm --version prints 2026.8.31. Deleted .agents/pm/runtime/history-drift-cache.json before each health run. Pre-repair pm health --strict-exit was already 0 after the previous run applied history-repair. Post-repair: pm health --strict-exit EXIT=0 with history_drift check ok. Removed stale merge-receipt stubs (007b7f1d, 901a254e) and added .agents/pm/merge-receipts/ to .gitignore — the newer pm binary flags hash-only merge receipts as merge_receipts_pending (gate_failing). No .toon files were modified: git status shows only .agents/pm/history/*.jsonl, package.json, package-lock.json, and .gitignore. The history-repair warnings (history_repair_discarded_authors, history_repair_reconcile_discards_events) are false alarms per pm-cli#1168."}]}],"before_hash":"fa07a0150fff0d50881afa4d28074b7cb2e06a8af65547d80d62ef56dd00b19d","after_hash":"ece6de704ccbd3f5661f4b512038313b2958e2c1df78deb711b92d20615abc3f","item_hash_version":3}
